{% comment %} 
                                                                Go Greek Megamenu
                                                                A megamenu section matching the Go Greek store design with: 
                                                                - Announcement bar with social icons 
                                                                - Dark header with currency, centered logo, user/search/cart 
                                                                - Grid dropdowns for Fraternity/Sorority (logo + title) 
                                                                - Multiple dropdown layout types 
{% endcomment %}

